Grammar

    0 $accept: programa $end

    1 programa: sentencia
    2         | programa sentencia

    3 $@1: %empty

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN TK_TABLA TK_ID $@1 TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA

    5 asignaciones: asignacion
    6             | asignaciones TK_COMA asignacion

    7 asignacion: TK_ID TK_IGUAL valor

    8 valor: TK_CADENA
    9      | TK_ENTERO
   10      | TK_BOOL
   11      | TK_ID


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    TK_INSERTAR (258) 4
    TK_EN (259) 4
    TK_TABLA (260) 4
    TK_VALORES (261) 4
    TK_FIN (262) 4
    TK_IGUAL (263) 7
    TK_COMA (264) 6
    TK_DOSPUNTOS (265) 4
    TK_PTOCOMA (266) 4
    TK_ID <sval> (267) 4 7 11
    TK_CADENA <sval> (268) 8
    TK_BOOL <sval> (269) 10
    TK_ENTERO <ival> (270) 9


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (16)
        on left: 0
    programa (17)
        on left: 1 2
        on right: 0 2
    sentencia (18)
        on left: 4
        on right: 1 2
    $@1 (19)
        on left: 3
        on right: 4
    asignaciones (20)
        on left: 5 6
        on right: 4 6
    asignacion (21)
        on left: 7
        on right: 5 6
    valor <sval> (22)
        on left: 8 9 10 11
        on right: 7


State 0

    0 $accept: . programa $end

    TK_INSERTAR  shift, and go to state 1

    programa   go to state 2
    sentencia  go to state 3


State 1

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR . TK_EN TK_TABLA TK_ID $@1 TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA

    TK_EN  shift, and go to state 4


State 2

    0 $accept: programa . $end
    2 programa: programa . sentencia

    $end         shift, and go to state 5
    TK_INSERTAR  shift, and go to state 1

    sentencia  go to state 6


State 3

    1 programa: sentencia .

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (programa)


State 4

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN . TK_TABLA TK_ID $@1 TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA

    TK_TABLA  shift, and go to state 7


State 5

    0 $accept: programa $end .

    $default  accept


State 6

    2 programa: programa sentencia .

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (programa)


State 7

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN TK_TABLA . TK_ID $@1 TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA

    TK_ID  shift, and go to state 8


State 8

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN TK_TABLA TK_ID . $@1 TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA

    $default  reduce using rule 3 ($@1)

    $@1  go to state 9


State 9

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN TK_TABLA TK_ID $@1 . TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA

    TK_VALORES  shift, and go to state 10


State 10

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN TK_TABLA TK_ID $@1 TK_VALORES . TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA

    TK_DOSPUNTOS  shift, and go to state 11


State 11

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN TK_TABLA TK_ID $@1 TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS . asignaciones TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA

    TK_ID  shift, and go to state 12

    asignaciones  go to state 13
    asignacion    go to state 14


State 12

    7 asignacion: TK_ID . TK_IGUAL valor

    TK_IGUAL  shift, and go to state 15


State 13

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN TK_TABLA TK_ID $@1 TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones . TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA
    6 asignaciones: asignaciones . TK_COMA asignacion

    TK_FIN   shift, and go to state 16
    TK_COMA  shift, and go to state 17


State 14

    5 asignaciones: asignacion .

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (asignaciones)


State 15

    7 asignacion: TK_ID TK_IGUAL . valor

    TK_ID      shift, and go to state 18
    TK_CADENA  shift, and go to state 19
    TK_BOOL    shift, and go to state 20
    TK_ENTERO  shift, and go to state 21

    valor  go to state 22


State 16

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN TK_TABLA TK_ID $@1 TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones TK_FIN . TK_PTOCOMA

    TK_PTOCOMA  shift, and go to state 23


State 17

    6 asignaciones: asignaciones TK_COMA . asignacion

    TK_ID  shift, and go to state 12

    asignacion  go to state 24


State 18

   11 valor: TK_ID .

    $default  reduce using rule 11 (valor)


State 19

    8 valor: TK_CADENA .

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (valor)


State 20

   10 valor: TK_BOOL .

    $default  reduce using rule 10 (valor)


State 21

    9 valor: TK_ENTERO .

    $default  reduce using rule 9 (valor)


State 22

    7 asignacion: TK_ID TK_IGUAL valor .

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (asignacion)


State 23

    4 sentencia: TK_INSERTAR TK_EN TK_TABLA TK_ID $@1 TK_VALORES TK_DOSPUNTOS asignaciones TK_FIN TK_PTOCOMA .

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (sentencia)


State 24

    6 asignaciones: asignaciones TK_COMA asignacion .

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (asignaciones)
